@startuml NV06_Sekvence_SchvaleniRezervace
' ============================================================
' NV06 – Vzory za běhu: schválení rezervace správcem
' State (přechod) + Observer (upozornění) + Adapter (e-mail, SQLite)
' Zpřesňuje sekvenční diagram SD03.
' ============================================================
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #777777
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #222222
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #222222
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam BoundaryBorderColor #222222
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #555555
skinparam SequenceGroupHeaderFontStyle bold
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B5A642

title NV06 – Schválení rezervace: State + Observer + Adapter

actor "Správce\nvozového parku" as M
participant "__r:Rezervace__" as R
participant "__s:CekaNaSchvaleni__" as C
participant "__p:Potvrzena__" as P
participant "__d:SqlDatabaze__" as DB
participant "__sqlite:sqlite3.Database__" as SQL
participant "__log:AuditniLog__" as L
participant "__mail:EmailovyPozorovatel__" as O
boundary "__e:EmailNotifikace__" as E
participant "__klient:SmtpKlient__" as K

== Povolená operace ve stavu CekaNaSchvaleni ==

M -> R : schvalit()
activate R
R -> C : schvalit()
activate C
create P
C -> P : «create» Potvrzena(r)
C -> R : nastavStav(p)
activate R
R -> DB : ulozRezervaci(r)
activate DB
DB -> SQL : run("UPDATE reservations ...", params, cb)
deactivate DB
R -> R : notify()
activate R
R -> L : update(r)
R -> O : update(r)
activate O
O -> E : odeslat(ridic.email, "Rezervace schválena")
activate E
E -> K : sendMail(ODESILATEL, ridic.email, "Car-side", text)
deactivate E
deactivate O
deactivate R
deactivate R
C --> R : hotovo
deactivate C
destroy C
R --> M : CONFIRMED
deactivate R

== Nepovolená operace: rezervace je už ve stavu Potvrzena ==

M -> R : zamitnout()
activate R
R -> P : zamitnout()
activate P
note right of P : Potvrzena tuto operaci nepřepisuje,\nplatí výchozí chování ze StavRezervace.
P --> R : chyba „ve stavu CONFIRMED nelze provést“
deactivate P
R --> M : chyba, stav se nemění
deactivate R

@enduml
